a7=a9.$2("Settings","Configures your next run before you press New. Name marks your Attempts on Record; Feedback picks which moments play a sound or trigger a vibration; and the Seed at the bottom is the exact code this configuration reproduces \u2014 paste a friend's to play their run (a run from a pasted Seed is Unranked), or copy or regenerate your own to share it. After you complete a run, the Seed changes, so your next run plays different words. Apply commits your changes and sends you home. One run of each Challenge type can be in progress at once: applying a different Challenge keeps your current run saved under Continue, while changing the run of the same Challenge asks before ending it. Continue shows a saved run's progress and settings before you go back in, and with several saved runs, lets you choose one first. Today's Daily and this week's Weekly can each be completed once; one you've abandoned can be started again, but that run is Unranked.")
